### Scarecrow Maple server endpoints
### Edit @host below to match the device's IP (see boot log / Resolver.Log output for "WiFi connected. IP: ...")
@host = 192.168.1.92:5417

### Info: the prop's name, kind and version as JSON (the remote's subnet scan uses it)
GET http://{{host}}/info

### Up: raises the lift (200 when done or already up, 500 if the relay failed). It lowers itself after App.LiftMaxUpSeconds (30s).
POST http://{{host}}/up

### Down: lowers the lift (200 when done or already down)
POST http://{{host}}/down
